msgstr "Datu Hobespenak"

msgctxt "PrefsData|"
msgid "Use default spreadsheet editor"
msgstr "Erabili kalkulu-orrien editore lehenetsia"

msgctxt "PrefsData|"
msgid "Select custom editor"
msgstr "Hautatu editore pertsonalizatua"

msgctxt "PrefsMissingValues|"
msgid "Missing Value List"
msgstr "Falta diren Balioen Zerrenda"

msgctxt "PrefsMissingValues|"
msgid "Remove missing value"
msgstr "Kendu falta diren balioak"

msgctxt "PrefsMissingValues|"
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Berrezarri"

msgctxt "PrefsResults|"
msgid "Results Preferences"
msgstr "Emaitzen Hobespenak"

msgctxt "PrefsResults|"
msgid "Table options"
msgstr "Taularen aukerak"

msgctxt "PrefsResults|"
msgid "Display exact p-values"
msgstr "Erakutsi p-balio zehatzak"

msgctxt "PrefsResults|"
msgid "Fix the number of decimals"
msgstr "Hamartar kopurua aukeratu"

msgctxt "PrefsResults|"
msgid "Plot options"
msgstr "Grafiko aukerak"

msgctxt "PrefsResults|"
msgid "Use PPI of screen in plots: "
msgstr "Pantailaren PPI grafikoetan erabili: "

msgctxt "PrefsResults|"
msgid "Use the Pixels Per Inch of your screen to render your plots."
msgstr "Pantailaren Hazbeteko Pixelak erabili grafikoak errendatzeko."

msgctxt "PrefsResults|"
msgid "Custom PPI: "
msgstr "PPI pertsonalizatua: "

msgctxt "PrefsResults|"
msgid "Image background color"
msgstr "Irudiaren atzeko planoaren kolorea"

msgctxt "PrefsResults|"
msgid "White"
msgstr "Zuria"

msgctxt "PrefsResults|"
msgid ""
"This makes the background of all plots white, quite useful if you want to "
"use it in LaTeX or submit it to a journal."
msgstr ""
"Honek grafiko guztien atzeko planoa zuri bihurtzen du, oso erabilgarria "
"LaTeX-en erabili edo aldizkari batera bidali nahi baduzu."

msgctxt "PrefsResults|"
msgid "Transparent"
msgstr "Gardena"

msgctxt "PrefsResults|"
msgid ""
"This makes the background of all plots transparent, quite useful if you want "
"to use it seamlessly on any background that isn't white."
msgstr ""
"Honek grafiko guztien atzeko planoa garden bihurtzen du, oso erabilgarria "
"zuria ez den edozein atzeko planotan modu jarraituan erabili nahi baduzu."

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid "Fonts"
msgstr "Letra-tipoak"

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid "Interface:"
msgstr "Interfazea:"

#, qt-format
msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid "default: %1"
msgstr "lehenetsia: %1"

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid "Themes"
msgstr "Gaiak"

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid ""
"Switches to a light theme, this is the default and original flavour of JASP."
msgstr ""
"Gai argi batera aldatzen du, hau da JASP-en lehenetsitako eta jatorrizko "
"zaporea."

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid ""
"Switches to a dark theme, makes JASP a lot easier on the eyes for those "
"night owls out there."
msgstr ""
"Gai ilun batera aldatzen du, JASP askoz errazagoa egiten du gaueko "
"hontzentzat begietarako."

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid "Miscellaneous options"
msgstr "Aukera desberdinak"

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid "Zoom (%): "
msgstr "Zooma (%): "

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid ""
"Increase or decrease the size of the interface elements (text, buttons, etc)."
msgstr ""
"Interfazearen elementuen tamaina handitu edo txikitu (testua, botoiak, "
"etab.)."

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid "Scroll speed (pix/s): "
msgstr "Korritze-abiadura (pix/s): "

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid ""
"Set the speed with which you can scroll in the options, dataviewer and other "
"places."
msgstr ""
"Ezarri aukeretan, datu-ikuslean eta beste leku batzuetan mugitzeko abiadura."

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid ""
"Switches to a \"safer\" mode for graphics aka software rendering.\n"
"It will make your interface slower but if you have some problems (weird "
"glitches, cannot see results or anything even) might fix them.\n"
"Analyses will still be just as fast though."
msgstr ""
"Grafikoetarako, hau da, softwarearen errendatzerako \"modu seguruago\" "
"batera aldatzen du.\n"
"Zure interfazea motelagoa izango da, baina arazoren bat baduzu (akats "
"arraroak, emaitzak ezin ikustea edo beste ezer), konpondu ditzake.\n"
"Hala ere, analisiak berdin azkarrak izango dira."

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid ""
"Turns off all animations, this is implied when \"Safe Graphics Mode\" is on."
msgstr ""
"Animazio guztiak desaktibatzen ditu, hau inplizituki adierazten da \"Grafiko "
