#, qt-format
msgctxt "CommunityWindow|"
msgid ""
"<h3>Community</h3>\n"
"The institutions of higher learning that participate in the JASP community "
"jointly support the maintenance and further development of JASP, therefore "
"providing an invaluable educational service to their own students and to "
"those of other institutions worldwide.\n"
"\n"
"If your institution is not yet part of the JASP community, you can <a "
"href=\"%1\">suggest that they join</a>.\n"
"Below the educators that helped make this release possible:\n"
"\n"
"<i><b>Gold Educators:</b></i>\n"
"%2\n"
"                 \n"
"<i><b>Silver Educators:</b></i>\n"
"%3\n"
"\n"
"<i><b>Bronze Educators:</b></i>\n"
"%4\n"
"\n"
"<a href=\"%6\">Click here for the current list of educators</a>\n"
msgstr ""
"<h3>Komunitatea</h3>\n"
"JASP komunitatean parte hartzen duten goi-mailako ikaskuntzako erakundeek "
"JASPen mantentze-lanak eta garapen gehiago elkarrekin laguntzen dituzte, "
"eta, beraz, hezkuntza-zerbitzu baliotsua eskaintzen diete beren ikasleei eta "
"mundu osoko beste erakunde batzuei.\n"
"\n"
"Zure erakundea oraindik JASP komunitateko kide ez bada, <a "
"href=\"%1\">sartzea iradoki diezaiekezu</a>.\n"
"Jarraian, argitalpen hau posible egiten lagundu duten hezitzaileak:\n"
"\n"
"<i><b>Urrezko Irakasleak:</b></i>\n"
"%2  \n"
"                                       \n"
"<i><b>Zilarrezko Irakasleak:</b></i>\n"
"%3\n"
"\n"
"<i><b>Brontzezko Irakasleak:</b></i>\n"
"%4\n"
"\n"
"<a href=\"%6\">Egin klik hemen hezitzaileen uneko zerrenda ikusteko</a>\n"

