msgid "Daily automatic check for updates & known issues"
msgstr "Eguneroko egiaztapen automatikoa eguneratzeen eta arazo ezagunen bila"

msgctxt "PrefsUI|"
msgid ""
"JASP doesn't share any of your data when it gets updates, not even which "
"version of JASP you are using.\n"
"It does share your IP-address with the server but that is required for "
"internet to function.\n"
"\n"
"The list of known issues it downloads is rarely used, mostly the issues are "
"at [jasp-issues](https://github.com/jasp-stats/jasp-issues/issues). However "
"if we realize a terrible error has slipped into an analysis this will show "
"you *in the analysis* that there is something you should take into account. "
"Luckily we almost never need to use it."
msgstr ""
"JASP-ek ez du zure daturik partekatzen eguneratzeak jasotzen dituenean, ezta "
"zein JASP bertsio erabiltzen ari zaren ere.\n"
"Zure IP helbidea zerbitzariarekin partekatzen du, baina hori beharrezkoa da "
"internetek funtziona dezan.\n"
"\n"
"Deskargatzen dituen arazo ezagunen zerrenda gutxitan erabiltzen da, gehienak "
"[jasp-issues](https://github.com/jasp-stats/jasp-issues/issues) helbidean "
"daude. Hala ere, errore larri bat analisi batean sartu dela konturatzen "
"bagara, honek *analisian* kontuan hartu beharreko zerbait dagoela erakutsiko "
"dizu. Zorionez, ia inoiz ez dugu erabili behar."

